WEBVTT

00:04:58.169 --> 00:05:01.672
I never overlooked the scientific
projections or data,

00:05:01.672 --> 00:05:02.673
but rather tuned in

00:05:02.673 --> 00:05:05.009
to the hard-to-find good news stories

00:05:05.009 --> 00:05:07.970
and examples of successful
on-the-ground work.

00:05:08.971 --> 00:05:10.222
And in the process,

00:05:10.222 --> 00:05:13.392
I uncovered the framework
that I had been yearning for:

00:05:13.392 --> 00:05:14.560
climate optimism.

00:05:16.145 --> 00:05:18.773
Climate optimism is a framework
based on the idea

00:05:18.773 --> 00:05:22.068
that despite the bleak projections
and the high stakes,

00:05:22.068 --> 00:05:24.153
we can restore our planet back to health,

00:05:24.153 --> 00:05:25.237
and in doing so,

00:05:25.237 --> 00:05:26.739
protect all that inhabit it.

00:05:27.782 --> 00:05:30.868
Climate optimism is what gives us hope
when things feel hopeless,